\n=== BRIEF 02 RULES (first 80 lines) ===
     1	## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence
     2	
     3	Auditor directive (mandatory for extract):
     4	
     5	Interview notes with the compliance desk confirmed status fights between mail,
     6	amendments, and corrections. Ledger rows provide the base status (lowercase on
     7	output). Status precedence from lowest to highest is: pending, approved,
     8	rejected, reversed. Email excerpts may change status only when the From line
     9	contains `compliance@` anywhere in the address; ignore all other senders.
