\n=== BRIEF 04 RULES (first 80 lines) ===
     1	## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence
     2	
     3	Controller memo (binding reconciliation rule):
     4	
     5	The corrections desk ships multiple notices per field. When several notices
     6	target the same transaction and field, the notice with the lexicographically
     7	greatest `effective` date wins. For each winning notice, `previous_value` in
     8	`reconciliation_report.jsonl` is the field value immediately before that notice
     9	applies (after ledger, amendments, and emails). Owner corrections override
    10	both ledger owners and signed meeting amendments when applied in this step.
    11	
